1
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:41,000
A legacy worth killing for.

2
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:16,000
House of Gucci is a drama, crime, history film directed by Ridley Scott.

3
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:51,000
When Patrizia Reggiani, an outsider from humble beginnings, marries into the Gucci family, her unbridled ambition begins to
unravel the family legacy and triggers a reckless spiral of betrayal, decadence, revenge, and ultimately… murder.

4
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Patrizia Reggiani, played by Lady Gaga.

5
00:32:55,000 --> 00:33:01,000
Maurizio Gucci, played by Adam Driver.

6
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:36,000
Aldo Gucci, played by Al Pacino.

7
00:46:05,000 --> 00:46:11,000
Rodolfo Gucci, played by Jeremy Irons.

8
00:52:40,000 --> 00:52:46,000
Paolo Gucci, played by Jared Leto.

9
00:59:15,000 --> 00:59:21,000
Domenico De Sole, played by Jack Huston.

10
01:05:50,000 --> 01:05:56,000
House of Gucci is a 2021 American biographical crime drama film directed by Ridley Scott, based on the 2001 book
The House of Gucci: A Sensational Story of Murder, Madness, Glamour, and Greed by Sara Gay Forden.

11
01:12:25,000 --> 01:12:31,000
The film follows Patrizia Reggiani (Lady Gaga) and Maurizio Gucci (Adam Driver) as their
romance transforms into a fight for control of the Italian fashion brand Gucci.

12
01:19:00,000 --> 01:19:06,000
Jared Leto, Jeremy Irons, Jack Huston, Salma Hayek and Al Pacino also star.

13
01:25:35,000 --> 01:25:41,000
Scott wanted to make a film about the Gucci dynasty after
acquiring rights to Forden's book in the early 2000s.

14
01:32:10,000 --> 01:32:16,000
The project languished for several years, with several directors and actors rumored to be
considered before Scott and Gaga became officially attached in November 2019.

15
01:38:45,000 --> 01:38:51,000
Much of the remaining cast joined the following summer, and filming
began in Italy, lasting from February through May 2021.

16
01:45:20,000 --> 01:45:26,000
The world premiere of House of Gucci was held at the Odeon Luxe
Leicester Square in London on November 9, 2021.

17
01:51:55,000 --> 01:52:01,000
It was theatrically released in the United States on November 24, 2021.

18
01:58:30,000 --> 01:58:36,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the cast's
performances but criticized the inconsistent tone and editing.

19
02:05:05,000 --> 02:05:11,000
Gaga and Leto were nominated for the Screen Actors Guild Award, Critics' Choice Award, and Satellite Award for Best Actress and
Best Supporting Actor, respectively, while Gaga also received nominations for the Golden Globe Award and BAFTA Award.

20
02:11:40,000 --> 02:11:46,000
The film also earned a nomination at the 94th Academy
Awards for Best Makeup and Hairstyling.

21
02:18:15,000 --> 02:18:21,000
It grossed more than $153 million against a $75 million budget.

22
02:24:50,000 --> 02:24:56,000
The film explores themes of marriage crisis, italy,
biography, fashion designer, murder.

23
02:31:25,000 --> 02:31:31,000
The tone is emotional.
